<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait 1996 air cargo up seven pct to 132,900 tonn.</title>
<headline>Kuwait 1996 air cargo up seven pct to 132,900 tonn.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait airport cargo volume rose by seven percent in 1996 to 132,900 tonnes compared with the previous year, an official report published on Tuesday said.</p>
<p>It said the number of passengers using the airport and total flights also rose in 1996 by seven percent each to 3.7 million and 33,789 flights, al-Watan newspaper reported.</p>
<p>The national flag carrier Kuwait Airways Corp handled 71 percent of total cargo and 61 percent of passengers on 15,436 flights in 1996.</p>
</text>
